PhoneBox 0.6.9 — panel: no endless CSS animations.
Why: clock colon (blink), session dots (pulse) and ON AIR / OBS (oa-glow) looped forever -> repaint on every frame.
- Clock colon: toggled by the clock widget's own 1 s tick (.dim on odd seconds), same look, no animation.
- pulse / oa-glow: 3–4 iterations, then a steady light.
Measured (8 s after load, document.getAnimations()): infinite 5 -> 0, running 5 -> 0.

